# IslandLevels: steps from parity/shell_modules_menubar_IslandLevels.qml.md (batches 1-5). Screen IRICE-TEST 1920x1080 scale 1;
# the island is centred at x 960 (closed y ~14, open ~392 wide); the bar is 30 px tall.
# Each block runs in both looks: the file runs top to bottom, Material first, then Glass.

look material
setup pactl load-module module-null-sink sink_name=test
setup wpctl set-volume @DEFAULT_AUDIO_SINK@ 5%+
wait 0.5
ptr glide 1150 20 300
ptr click
wait 0.6
shot levels
note under the volume row: the outputs (default bold, checked), and any app playing with its own level; the caret is now caret-up
ptr glide 900 80 200
ptr click
wait 0.6
shot switched
note the clicked output is now checked (pactl get-default-sink agrees)
ptr glide 1150 20 200
ptr click
wait 0.4
shot closed
note the list closed

look glass
setup pactl load-module module-null-sink sink_name=test
setup wpctl set-volume @DEFAULT_AUDIO_SINK@ 5%+
wait 0.5
ptr glide 1150 20 300
ptr click
wait 0.6
shot levels
note under the volume row: the outputs (default bold, checked), and any app playing with its own level; the caret is now caret-up
ptr glide 900 80 200
ptr click
wait 0.6
shot switched
note the clicked output is now checked (pactl get-default-sink agrees)
ptr glide 1150 20 200
ptr click
wait 0.4
shot closed
note the list closed
